===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[interact]] [[social]]ly for the purpose of getting connections or personal [[advance]]ment.
#: {{ux|en|Many people find it worthwhile to '''network''' for jobs and information.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To connect two or more [[computer]]s or other computerized devices.
#: {{ux|en|If we '''network''' his machine to the server, he will be able to see all the files.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[interconnect]] a [[group]] or [[system]].
# {{lb|en|transitive|broadcasting}} To [[broadcast]] across an entire network of stations and affiliates at the same time.

